OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and bright day with
OL,6,Flengthy sunny spells. Light to
OL,7,Fmoderate easterly winds throughout,
OL,8,Fleading to a cooler feel around the
OL,9,Fcoastal areas, but turning
OL,10,Fincreasingly humid.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry start to the evening
OL,13,Fbut cloud will start to thicken across
OL,14,Fhigher ground to the north overnight.
OL,15,FThundery showers moving into the
OL,16,Fsouth. Feeling mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
