OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy start to Wednesday
OL,6,Fwith thundery showers. Cloud lifts
OL,7,Finto the afternoon, bringing some
OL,8,Fbrighter and even sunny spells. Any
OL,9,Fdaytime showers will fade into the
OL,10,Fevening. Feeling warm.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FChangeable weather with spells of
OL,14,Fheavy rain, some thunderstorms and
OL,15,Fstrong winds. Brighter intervals and
OL,16,Fscattered showers at times.
OL,17,FTemperatures mostly near normal,
OL,18,Ffeeling warm and humid in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
